s/call-transcripts/2018/11/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q3-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2018 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2018-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"We took a restructuring charge to GAAP earnings in Q3 with some benefit realized in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q3-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2019-05-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Pagano","x":"We continue to monitor the US trade and tariff situation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2019-05-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Pagano","x":"For enacted tariffs we instituted price increases in the second half of 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2019-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"If you recall, about $4 million or approximately 2% points of pre-buy sales were shipped in the second quarter of 2018 in anticipation of the price increase that went into effect in July 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2019-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Pagano","x":"As we look, as you remember, we put in price increases in the second half of last year and we knew some of the first half comps this year would be positive as it related to price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2019-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"Margin expansion was driven by higher volume, pricing productivity including restructuring savings and was partially offset by unfavorable product mix, inflation, and incremental investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2019-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"Investments will be partially offset by approximately $1 million in incremental restructuring savings all in Europe.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q2","e":"wts","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"We addressed the latest round of tariff increase in the U.S. with additional price increases, which went into effect on July 1st.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q2","e":"wts","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"In Europe, obviously, a lot less, because obviously, there's not the tariff impact that drove the price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q2","e":"wts","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"We will continue to monitor market reaction to these enacted price increases as the second half progresses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q2","e":"wts","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Adam Farley","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q2","e":"wts","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"The margin improvement was driven by price, productivity including restructuring savings and volume offset partially by inflation, mix and incremental investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q2","e":"wts","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"We've done a lot of margin improvement based on the restructuring that we've done and you've seen over the -- in the fourth quarter and the first half of this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"Recall that last year, the Americas purchase additional product from our Chinese sister companies in anticipation of the higher tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q3-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"So some of that was related to the tariffs and -- but overall we see very good activity but we look at the leading indicators as those are something we look at on a forward basis is predicting our future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q3-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"The organic growth was driven by price realization and volume increases in plumbing valves, drains and water quality products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q3-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"Also the prebuy during the second quarter ahead of the previously announced July 1 price increases, negatively impacted the Americas sales growth by about 2% in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q3-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"Price productivity including restructuring savings and higher volume partially offset by investments and inflation were the main drivers of the record margin performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q3-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"First, we incurred $2.3 million of professional fees including legal and tax costs to optimize and simplify our European legal structure from a pan-European perspective and align with previous restructuring initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q3-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2020-02-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy M. MacPhee","x":"At this point we have not factored in any tariff changes as they are unknown.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2020-02-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy M. MacPhee","x":"Brexit has moved forward, the U.S. MCA agreement has been signed and there has been more constructive activity lately regarding tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2020-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy M. MacPhee","x":"This year we increased consolidated adjusted operating margin by 60 basis points, driven by price realization, volume growth and productivity initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2020-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy M. MacPhee","x":"From a phasing perspective, we expect stronger quarter-over-quarter revenue growth in the second half of 2020, as compare should be tougher in the first half, given the timing of price increases that positively impacted the first half of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2020-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy M. MacPhee","x":"Benefits from price, volume, productivity and restructuring savings, more than offset higher inflation and incremental growth and productivity investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2019 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2020-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy M. MacPhee","x":"Adjusted operating margin of 11.8% increased 90 basis points, primarily due to price, volume and productivity including restructuring savings, which more than offset investments and inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2020 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2020-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Jones","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/07/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WTS 2020 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"In addition, we have initiated reductions in force merit deferrals and furloughs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/07/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"