ngs/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q3-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"WTS 2020 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"For GAAP purposes, we recorded a charge of $3.4 million primarily related to the previously announced and expanded restructuring initiatives, most of that being severance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q3-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"WTS 2020 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2021-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"We have announced price increases to help mitigate the current cost increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"WTS 2020 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2021-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"We implemented price increases of 3% to 5% in January.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"WTS 2020 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"Benefits from cost actions, including restructuring and productivity savings, more than offset lower volume and incremental growth and productivity investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"WTS 2020 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"The margin increase was driven by cost savings and productivity, which more than offset the volume reduction and incremental investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"WTS 2021 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"Operationally, commodity increases, especially in copper, steel and packaging supplies coupled with the increases in logistics costs have driven us to announce additional price increases globally.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"WTS 2021 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"We won't see the real benefit of that price increase until the second half of 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"WTS 2021 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2021-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"We expect adjusted operating margin in the Americas may be up versus 2020, driven by the drop through benefits of the freeze, along with the incremental cost savings and productivity initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"WTS 2021 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2021-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shashank Patel","x":"Adjusted operating margin maybe up from incremental drop-through on volume, price and cost savings initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"WTS 2021 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"We are increasing our full year outlook given the stronger than expected first half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"WTS 2021 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"We have increased our full year outlook given the strong start to the year while remaining prudent concerning the second half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/watts-water-technologies-inc-wts-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"WTS 2021 Q2","e