e increases reflect the benefit of price, volume, and productivity gains which more than compensated for inflation, European volume deleverage, tariffs, and acquisition-related dilution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/watts-water-wts-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2025 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2026-02-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Diane M. McClintock","x":"Price contribution will be higher in the first half, particularly Q1, due to carryover effect of prior year tariff-related price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/watts-water-wts-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2025 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2026-02-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Diane M. McClintock","x":"We expect higher price in the first quarter as we carry over some of the price increases we had in the fourth quarter—think high single digits in Q1, then ramping down over the year and averaging out to low single digits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/watts-water-wts-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2025 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2026-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Diane M. McClintock","x":"For GAAP reporting, after-tax charges of $22.3 million were recorded related to restructuring and acquisition-related costs, partly offset by an $8.3 million tax benefit from the reversal of a prior year tax liability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/watts-water-wts-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2025 Q4","e":"wts","d":"2026-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Diane M. McClintock","x":"Margin expansion from price, volume leverage, and productivity and restructuring savings is expected to be partially offset by inflation and 50 basis points of acquisition dilution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/watts-water-wts-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Diane M. McClintock","x":"These improvements were primarily driven by favorable pricing, volume leverage, and productivity gains, more than offsetting inflationary pressure, tariffs, and acquisition dilution of 80 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/watts-water-wts-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Diane M. McClintock","x":"The cash flow decrease was primarily due to the increase in accounts receivable due to higher sales volume, increases in and timing of our annual customer rebate payments, and an increase in inventory related to incremental tariffs and our strategic investment in inventory.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/watts-water-wts-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Diane M. McClintock","x":"We anticipate mid- to high-single-digit growth in the Americas, despite the tough compare to the second quarter last year, which included an estimated $20 million of pull-forward sales into the second quarter from the third quarter due to the timing of price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/watts-water-wts-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Diane M. McClintock","x":"We started with price increases, which is always the first piece, and we are getting a good response.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/watts-water-wts-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"In light of these factors, we believe it is prudent to maintain our full-year outlook, and we will revisit it on our next earnings call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/watts-water-wts-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q1","e":"wts","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Robert J. Pagano","x":"We are maintaining our full-year outlook despite the macro and geopolitical uncertainty.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/watts-water-wts-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q2","e":"wts","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Pagano","x":"The tariff environment also remains fluid with new Section 301 and 338 tariffs recently announced.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/watts-water-technologies-wts-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q2","e":"wts","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Pagano","x":"These are in addition to the Section 232 currently in effect and replace the Section 122 tariffs, which recently expired.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/watts-water-technologies-wts-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q2","e":"wts","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Pagano","x":"Data center growth, price realization and performance in Europe and APMEA are all better than expected versus the outlook we provided in May.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/watts-water-technologies-wts-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q2","e":"wts","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Diane McClintock","x":"We anticipate high single-digit to low double-digit growth in the Americas, which is sequentially lower than the second quarter due to the pull-forward demand previously discussed and the sequential decline in price as we comp prior year price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/watts-water-technologies-wts-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q2","e":"wts","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Diane McClintock","x":"Europe segment margin is now expected to increase 20 to 80 basis points based on strong price and productivity, which includes the expected benefits from our France restructuring program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/watts-water-technologies-wts-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Pagano","x":"We are maintaining a positive price-cost relationship despite persistent inflation in commodities, tariffs, freight, logistics, wages and benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/watts-water-wts-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Diane McClintock","x":"And just to confirm, adjusted earnings excludes the impact of $39 million of tariff refunds received in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/watts-water-wts-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Pagano","x":"We will be putting in a price increase in the first -- at the beginning of the year, like we always do, but nowhere near the size that we did with the tariffs, et cetera.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/watts-water-wts-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Pagano","x":"So think about a normal price increases in the 2 percentage area as we go into next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/watts-water-wts-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WTS 2026 Q3","e":"wts","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Diane McClintock","x":"Europe's segment margin is now expected to increase 90 to 100 basis points based on strong price and productivity improvements and the benefits of our France restructuring program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/watts-water-wts-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,5896,0,0,0,4552,950],[37,1,4979,0,0,0,4032,607],[38,1,4619,0,0,0,4048,265],[39,1,4525,0,0,0,4059,152],[40,1,7860,0,0,0,4281,3280],[41,1,5163,0,0,0,4089,726],[42,1,5674,0,0,0,4580,768],[43,1,5659,0,0,0,4297,926],[44,1,8105,0,0,0,6677,1051],[45,1,6551,0,0,0,5099,842],[46,1,7045,0,0,0,3393,3286],[47,1,4369,0,0,0,3349,727],[62,1,5821,0,0,0,4202,1257],[64,1,5399,0,0,0,1530,3454],[65,1,3985,0,0,0,1293,2366],[66,1,6277,0,0,0,5169,802],[67,1,4973,0,0,0,3577,1115]],"cinema":[[35,1,5896,0,0,0,4552,950],[37,1,4979,0,0,0,4032,607],[38,1,4619,0,0,0,4048,265],[39,1,4525,0,0,0,4059,152],[40,1,7860,0,0,0,4281,3280],[41,1,5163,0,0,0,4089,726],[42,1,5674,0,0,0,4580,768],[43,1,5659,0,0,0,4297,926],[44,1,8105,0,0,0,6677,1051],[45,1,6551,0,0,0,5099,842],[46,1,7045,0,0,0,3393,3286],[47,1,4369,0,0,0,3349,727],[62,1,5821,0,0,0,4202,1257],[64,1,5399,0,0,0,1530,3454],[65,1,3985,0,0,0,1293,2366],[66,1,6277,0,0,0,5169,802],[67,1,4973,0,0,0,3577,1115]],"imax":[[35,1,5896,0,0,0,4552,950],[37,1,4979,0,0,0,4032,607],[38,1,4619,0,0,0,4048,265],[39,1,4525,0,0,0,4059,152],[40,1,7860,0,0,0,4281,3280],[41,1,5163,0,0,0,4089,726],[42,1,5674,0,0,0,4580,768],[43,1,5659,0,0,0,4297,926],[44,1,8105,0,0,0,6677,1051],[45,1,6551,0,0,0,5099,842],[46,1,7045,0,0,0,3393,3286],[47,1,4369,0,0,0,3349,727],[62,1,5821,0,0,0,4202,1257],[64,1,5399,0,0,0,1530,3454],[65,1,3985,0,0,0,1293,2366],[66,1,6277,0,0,0,5169,802],[67,1,4973,0,0,0,3577,1115]],"streaming":[[35,1,5896,0,0,0,4552,950],[37,1,4979,0,0,0,4032,607],[38,1,4619,0,0,0,4048,265],[39,1,4525,0,0,0,4059,152],[40,1,7860,0,0,0,4281,3280],[41,1,5163,0,0,0,4089,726],[42,1,5674,0,0,0,4580,768],[43,1,5659,0,0,0,4297,926],[44,1,8105,0,0,0,6677,1051],[45,1,6551,0,0,0,5099,842],[46,1,7045,0,0,0,3393,3286],[47,1,4369,0,0,0,3349,727],[62,1,5821